4
00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:17.143
Today we learn about Road Safety Policy. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.265 --> 00:00:22.199
Policy. Say it with me. Policy!

6
00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:29.753
Speed limits. Say it with me. Speed limits!

7
00:00:33.219 --> 00:00:37.452
Helmet law. Say it with me. Helmet law!

8
00:00:41.004 --> 00:00:45.121
Enforcement. Say it with me. Enforcement!

9
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.687
Drink driving. Say it with me. Drink driving!

10
00:00:56.209 --> 00:01:00.609
Infrastructure. Say it with me. Infrastructure!

11
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.636
Education. Say it with me. Education!

12
00:01:12.109 --> 00:01:15.642
