13
00:01:19.176 --> 00:01:31.794
Road safety policy includes speed limits, a helmet law, drink-driving rules, and enforcement. Safe infrastructure, education, and data help reduce deaths.

14
00:01:31.844 --> 00:01:35.350
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:36.053 --> 00:01:41.403
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.453 --> 00:01:42.648
Helmet law!

17
00:01:43.771 --> 00:01:49.384
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:50.714
Education!

19
00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:57.517
Did you know? Helmet laws that are well enforced greatly increase helmet use!

20
00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.898
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.807 --> 00:02:09.895
Think and answer. How can data help improve road safety?

22
00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:11.279
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:17.450
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
